Package: ggcolonviz
Title: A 'ggplot2' Extension for Visualizing the Colon
Version: 0.0.6
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yoni", "Sidi", , "yoni.sidi@sanofi.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sanofi", role = "cph")
    )
SystemRequirements: GDAL (>= 2.0.1), GEOS (>= 3.4.0), PROJ (>= 4.8.0), sqlite3
Description: Provides a 'ggplot2' extension for creating clear, customizable
    visualizations of the colon. Includes geometry and label layers for
    plotting colon anatomy and overlaying related data, along with helpers
    for converting colon segments to 'sf' polygons and generating heatmap
    grids across the colon geometry.
